    "chunk_text": "ndum. \u00d0a beorhtan steorran getacnia\u00f0 \u00f0a geleaffullan on Godes gela\u00f0unge, \u00f0e on goddre drohtnunge scina\u00f0. Crist so\u00f0lice onliht hi ealle \u00feurh his gife, swa swa se godspellere Iohannes cw\u00e6\u00f0; Erat lux uera, que N\u00e6f\u00f0 ure nan nan leoht \u00e6nigre godnysse buton of Cristes gife, se \u00f0e is so\u00f0re rihtwisnysse sunne DE PRIMO DIE S\u00e6CULI, SIUE DE EQUINOCTIO UERNALI. \u00d0one forman d\u00e6g \u00feyssere worulde we magon afindan \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6s lenctenlices emnihtes d\u00e6ge, for\u00f0an \u00f0e \u00d0ry dagas w\u00e6ron \u00e6r \u00f0am d\u00e6ge buton sunnan & monan & eallum steorrum; & on \u00feam feor\u00f0an d\u00e6ge \u00d0\u00e6s ylcan d\u00e6ges he gesette \u00f0one monan fulne on \u00e6fnunge, on eastd\u00e6le mid scinendum steorrum We willa\u00f0 fur\u00f0or ymbe \u00f0as emnihte swi\u00f0or sprecan on gedafenlicere stowe; & we secga\u00f0 nu sceortlice Embe \u00f0is we spreca\u00f0 eft swi\u00f0or, swa swa we \u00e6r beheton. DE NOCTE. Niht is gesett mannum to reste on \u00f0isum middanearde. So\u00f0lice on \u00f0am heofenlicum e\u00f0ele nis nan niht geh\u00e6fd, ac \u00f0\u00e6r is singal leoht buton \u00e6lcum \u00f0eostrum. Ure eor\u00f0lice niht so\u00f0lice cym\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6re eor\u00f0an sceade. \u00deonne seo sunne g\u00e6\u00f0 on \u00e6fnunge under \u00f0yssere eor\u00f0an, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00f0an bradnys",
